ents working in the lab are instructed by professor David.**\n   - This means that if James works in the lab, he must be instructed by professor David.\n\n6.**James is a student working in the lab.**\n   - This means that James works in the lab.\n\n7.**Jack neither has a part-time job offered by the university nor works in the lab.**\n   - This means that Jack does not have a part-time job offered by the university and does not work in the lab.\n\nNow, let\'s consider the possible scenarios for James:\n\nThe statement is false.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
