f someone fulfills their nutritional daily intakes, they likely grew up in a health-conscious childhood home.\n\n4.**If people have good relationships with their parents, then they fulfill their nutritional daily intakes.**.\n   - This suggests that if someone has a good relationship with their parents, they are likely to fulfill their nutritional daily intakes.\n\n5.**If people have good relationships with their parents, then they do not eat salads regularly.**.\n   - This implies that if someone has a good relationship with their parents, they are unlikely to eat salads regularly.\n\n6.**If people visit the gym at least once a day, then they always fulfill their daily nutritional intakes.**.\n   - This indicates that if someone visits the gym at least once a day, they are likely to fulfill their daily nutritional intakes.\n\n7.**It is either both true that Taylor grew up in a health-conscious childhood home and she has a good relationship with her parents, or it is true that Taylor neither grew up in a health-conscious childhood home nor has a good relationship with her parents.Based on the above information, the statement is true. Taylor visits the gym at least once a day.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
