e WTA, it follows that all female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 are ranked highly by the WTA.\n   - Coco Gauff is a player who lost to Iga Świątek, so she is ranked highly by the WTA.\n\n3.**Determine Coco Gauff\'s Status:**.Coco Gauff is not considered a top player in professional tennis because she is not ranked highly by the WTA.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
