organizing the spaces in their home, then they do not go to bed late and wake up every day after noon.\n   - Remy either both goes to bed late and wakes up every day after noon and spends their free time tidying and organizing the spaces in their home, or they do not go to bed late and wake up every day after noon nor spend their free time tidying and organizing the spaces in their home.\n\n2.**Identify Relevant Information:**.\n   - The relevant information for determining whether Remy visits the office supply store regularly is:.\n     - All people who work regularly and often at home visit the office supply store regularly.\n     - Remy either both goes to bed late and wakes up every day after noon and spends their free time tidying and organizing the spaces in their home, or they do not go to bed late and wake up every day after noon nor spend their free time tidying and organizing the spaces in their home.Remy does not visit the office supply store regularly because they do not spend their free time tidying and organizing the spaces in their home.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
