, and the security deposit is no more than $1500**: This condition states that Tom will rent an apartment in a managed building only if he is allowed to move in with his cat Fluffy and the security deposit is no more than $1500.\n\nNow, let's analyze the situation:.\n\nTom will rent an apartment in The Olive Garden because the security deposit is $2000.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
