se, or uncertain.\n\n3.**Reasoning:**\n   - Since all female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 lost to Iga Świątek, and Coco Gauff is a female tennis player (as she is mentioned in the context), she must have lost to Iga Świątek.Coco Gauff is not a player who won against Iga Świątek and is definitely one of the least active players in major tennis.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
