the logical implications they entail.Specifically, the information states that all cupcakes are spicy, no hotpots are spicy, all bakeries are cupcakes, all products of Baked by Melissa are hotpots, and if dried Thai chilies are spicy or a bakery, then they cannot be a hotpot or spicy.Since dried Thai chilies are a bakery and spicy, they must be a hotpot.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
